  "text": "This outfit is crafted for your evening at the restaurant, where you want to feel elegant and festive. The rich brown tones of your sweater, dress, and beanie create a sophisticated, grounded palette perfect for winter gatherings, while the soft milky boots and luxurious purple bag introduce a gentle contrast that feels both special and wearable. Your long black cardigan adds warmth without hiding your silhouette, letting you carry the evening comfortably from arrival to dancing.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Start with the sweater tucked into your dress for a clean waistline, then layer the black cardigan loosely over when the room gets cool or as you move outside.",
    "Keep your hair down in loose waves to let your face and eyes pop under the restaurant lights—this works especially well with the beanie’s soft ribbing."
